# Signed update files must keep their exact bytes on every checkout. The
# Ed25519 signature of update.json covers the bytes, so one converted line
# ending (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) makes the signature invalid and the
# fixture tests fail on that machine. CI builds and signs its own copies; this
# only protects the committed test fixtures and any copy committed later.
test/services/update/fixtures/** -text
update.json -text
update.json.sig -text

# Packages are never text.
*.apk binary
*.zip binary
